DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nDanny Jolles LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club\nComedian Danny Jolles brings his acclaimed stand-up to the iconic Punch Line Comedy Club in San Francisco on Wednesday\, August 12\, 2026. Known for his clever writing and charismatic stage presence\, Danny Jolles delivers a night of laughs you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, August 12\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – San Francisco\nAddress: 444 Battery Street\, San Francisco\, CA 94111\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2-drink minimum per person \nAbout Danny Jolles\nDanny Jolles is a New York-based stand-up comedian who has appeared on Comedy Central\, Late Night with Seth Meyers\, and numerous comedy festivals. His sharp writing and likable persona have made him a fan favorite on the club circuit. He is known for his clever observations on modern life\, relationships\, and pop culture. \nWhat to Expect\n\nPolished stand-up comedy from a rising national headliner\nClever writing with sharp punchlines and great storytelling\nIntimate club atmosphere at San Francisco’s top comedy venue\nFull bar and food service available throughout the show\n18+ show with a 2-drink minimum per person\nGeneral admission seating — arrive early for best seats\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club is San Francisco’s most celebrated stand-up comedy venue\, nestled in the Financial District at 444 Battery Street. With its intimate layout and legendary history of hosting comedy’s biggest names\, it’s the perfect place to catch a live show. \nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $45 – $85 and are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). All sales are final. Shows at Punch Line regularly sell out — secure your seats early. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
