DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nUsama Siddiquee: Right After You Left LIVE at Hollywood Palladium\nUsama Siddiquee brings his highly anticipated stand-up special “Right After You Left” to the iconic Hollywood Palladium for one unforgettable night on August 12\, 2026. \nThis is a Vinyl Room @ the Palladium show — an intimate stage experience inside one of Hollywood’s most legendary venues. \nEvent Details\nDate: Wednesday\, August 12\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM PDT (Doors open at 7:00 PM) \nVenue: Hollywood Palladium (Vinyl Room) \nAddress: 6215 W Sunset Blvd\, Hollywood\, CA 90028 \nAge Requirement: 18+ Event \nAbout Usama Siddiquee\nUsama Siddiquee is a rising stand-up comedian known for his sharp\, introspective humor and relatable storytelling. He has built a loyal following through his live performances and online presence\, earning a reputation as one of the most exciting voices in contemporary comedy. \n“Right After You Left” is his most personal and polished show yet — a journey through heartbreak\, growth\, and the absurdity of modern life. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA full-length stand-up performance by Usama Siddiquee\nSharp\, personal comedy about relationships and self-discovery\nIntimate Vinyl Room setting inside the Hollywood Palladium\nAn 18+ event — valid photo ID required at entry\nOne of the most anticipated comedy shows in LA this summer\n\nVenue Information\nThe Hollywood Palladium is one of Los Angeles’ most iconic entertainment venues\, located at 6215 W Sunset Blvd in Hollywood. The Vinyl Room is an intimate stage space within the Palladium\, offering a close\, personal comedy experience. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $84. This is an 18+ event. \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
