SUMMARY:Sara Huntington LIVE at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nSara Huntington LIVE at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nCatch Sara Huntington live at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa for a Thursday night of sharp\, engaging stand-up comedy. Known for her clever humor and captivating stage presence\, Sara Huntington is a rising comedian who delivers a memorable performance every time she takes the stage. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 234\, Tulsa\, OK 74133\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Price: $22 \nAbout Sara Huntington\nSara Huntington is a stand-up comedian known for her sharp wit\, clever observations\, and engaging storytelling. She has performed at comedy clubs and venues across the country\, building a following with her authentic\, relatable humor. Sara’s comedy draws from real-life experiences and delivers laughs with intelligence and heart. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, clever stand-up comedy with engaging storytelling\nRelatable humor that resonates with diverse audiences\nWitty observations on everyday life\nIntimate Thursday night show at Loony Bin Tulsa\nFull bar and dining available during the show\n\nVenue Information\nLoony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa at 6808 S Memorial Dr\, Ste. 234 is Tulsa’s heart for live stand-up comedy. With no seat more than 50 feet from the stage\, a full bar\, and a complete dining menu\, it’s the perfect spot for a weeknight comedy outing. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Sara Huntington at Loony Bin Comedy Club Tulsa are just $22. Purchase directly through the Loony Bin website. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
