SUMMARY:Jessica Kirson LIVE at The United Theater on Broadway
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nJessica Kirson\, one of the most electrifying stand-up comedians working today\, brings her high-energy\, no-holds-barred comedy to The United Theater on Broadway in Los Angeles on August 13\, 2026. \nKnown for her explosive stage presence and fearless material\, Kirson has become a favorite of comedy fans and fellow comedians alike. She has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Conan\, and released her own Comedy Central special. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM PDT\nVenue: The United Theater on Broadway\nAddress: 929 S Broadway\, Los Angeles\, CA 90015\nTickets From: $59\n\nAbout Jessica Kirson\nJessica Kirson is a stand-up comedian\, actress\, and producer known for her raw\, physical comedy style. She has been praised by Jerry Seinfeld\, Louis C.K.\, and Chris Rock. Her Comedy Central special and podcast Disgusting Hawk have earned her a devoted following. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
