SUMMARY:Sam Jay LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nSam Jay is a stand-up comic\, actor\, and Emmy-nominated writer best known as the host and executive producer of HBO’s Pause with Sam Jay\, a weekly late-night series. \nShe is a two-time Emmy nominee and WGA Award nominee for her writing on Saturday Night Live. Sam debuted her first one-hour stand-up special Sam Jay: 3 in the Morning on Netflix in 2020\, and her next special Sam Jay: Salute Me or Shoot Me premiered on HBO. \nSam has appeared in the Kenya Barris-directed Netflix film You People alongside Jonah Hill\, Eddie Murphy\, and Julia Louis-Dreyfus\, and co-created the Peacock series Bust Down. She was named one of Variety’s 10 Comics to Watch and a Comedy Central Comic to Watch. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nFood & Beverage: 2-item minimum per person once seated\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club (LOL San Antonio) is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco\, just inside the loop and a few miles from the airport. \nThe intimate club setting creates an electric atmosphere where every seat feels close to the stage\, making for an incredibly personal and engaging comedy experience. \nThe venue features a full bar and dining service\, so guests can enjoy food and drinks throughout the show. Seating is first come\, first served by section\, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best seats. \nLOL San Antonio is part of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club network\, consistently bringing top-tier national touring comedians to San Antonio. \nWhat to Expect\nSam Jay delivers a full headlining stand-up set packed with her signature sharp wit\, candid observations\, and fearless comedic voice. \nExpect incisive commentary on modern life\, relationships\, and culture delivered with the same unfiltered energy that has made her one of the most acclaimed comedians working today. \nThis is an 18+ event. Arrive early to grab a great seat and enjoy the full club experience with food and drinks before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $22 – $40 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through official and resale channels: \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sam-jay-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/
