SUMMARY:Josh Wolf: Touring Hard LIVE at Punch Line Houston
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Performer\nJosh Wolf is a veteran stand-up comedian\, actor\, and television personality best known as a longtime panelist on Chelsea Lately on E! Network. With over two decades of experience in comedy\, Wolf has built a reputation as one of the most consistently funny and relatable performers on the road today. \nHis stand-up style is rooted in real life — marriage\, fatherhood\, and the beautiful chaos of raising a family. Josh has a gift for turning everyday frustrations into laugh-out-loud moments that resonate with audiences of all ages. His storytelling is warm\, honest\, and genuinely hilarious. \nThe Touring Hard show is Josh Wolf’s latest live comedy tour\, bringing his best material and new stories to clubs and theaters across the country. Houston is lucky to have him at the intimate Punch Line stage. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Houston\nAddress: 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX 77002\nAge Restriction: 18+ (2 Beverage Minimum per person)\nTicket Prices: $38 – $50 (fees included)\n\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Houston is the go-to comedy club in downtown Houston\, situated at 1204 Caroline Street. This Live Nation venue is known for bringing top-tier national comedians to an intimate\, club-style setting that puts you close to the action. \nThe general admission layout means you can find a great spot anywhere in the room\, with preferred seating upgrades available for those who want the best views. The full bar keeps the drinks flowing\, and the 2-beverage minimum per person is part of the club experience. \nValet parking is available at most shows. The Green Street garage on Clay between Main and Fannin provides additional parking with convenient skybridge access. The venue is cashless — all major credit and debit cards accepted. \nWhat to Expect\nJosh Wolf’s Touring Hard show is a masterclass in relatable comedy. Expect a full evening of polished stand-up that covers family life\, relationships\, and the hilarious realities of getting older. Wolf’s natural charisma and crowd connection make every show feel unique. \nThe Thursday night show kicks off at 7:30 PM\, with doors opening at 6:30 PM. Additional shows are available Friday August 14 and Saturday August 15 for those who can’t make the Thursday performance. The show runs approximately 90 minutes. \nRemember: no cell phones\, no recording\, and no heckling. Just sit back\, relax\, and enjoy one of the best stand-up comedians working today. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $38 for general admission and up to $50 for preferred seating (all-in pricing\, fees included before taxes). Secure your seats through Ticketmaster or browse resale options on VividSeats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-wolf-touring-hard-live-at-punch-line-houston/
LOCATION:Punch Line Houston\, 1204 Caroline Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United States
