SUMMARY:Troy Bond LIVE at San Jose Improv
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nTroy Bond is a fast-rising stand-up comedian and writer based in New York City\, known for his sharp joke writing\, expert crowdwork\, and tongue-in-cheek celebrity impressions. With over 3 million followers across social media platforms\, Troy has built one of the most engaged comedy audiences of his generation. \nAt just 27 years old\, Troy has already made a major mark on the comedy world. He was selected for the prestigious 2023 Just for Laughs New Faces of Comedy lineup — a showcase that has launched the careers of Kevin Hart\, Taylor Tomlinson\, Kumail Nanjiani\, and many more. He began performing stand-up at age 17 and has been selling out headlining shows across the United States ever since. \nTroy’s comedy tackles everything from capitalism and politics to superheroes and pop culture\, delivered with a versatile comedic voice that resonates with audiences of all backgrounds. He also co-hosts the BONDING podcast with fellow comedian Torey Cole\, where the duo discuss comedy\, life\, and everything in between. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\nShow Time: 8:00 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nAge Restriction: 21+ (Valid photo ID required)\nContent: Adult language and themes\nTwo-item minimum purchase required in the showroom\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe San Jose Improv is one of the Bay Area’s most beloved comedy clubs\, situated in the heart of downtown San Jose at 62 S Second St. As part of the nationally recognized Improv Comedy Club chain\, the San Jose location has been a launching pad and destination for the biggest names in stand-up comedy. \nThe intimate venue seats approximately 250 guests in a general admission\, first-come-first-served format\, with premium booth and table options available for a more elevated experience. Every seat in the house offers an excellent view of the stage\, making it one of the best places in the Bay Area to catch live comedy up close. \nThe club features a full bar and food menu\, with a mandatory two-item minimum per guest in the showroom. Parking is available in nearby downtown San Jose garages and street parking. The venue is conveniently located near public transit options in the heart of downtown San Jose. \nWhat to Expect\nTroy Bond’s live show is a high-energy\, fast-paced stand-up performance that showcases his exceptional joke-writing ability and natural stage charisma. Known for his ability to work the crowd and adapt on the fly\, Troy delivers a show that feels both polished and spontaneous. \nExpect sharp observational humor\, clever impressions\, and material that ranges from personal anecdotes to broader cultural commentary. Troy’s youthful energy and precision comedy make him one of the most exciting live performers working today. This is a 21+ event with adult-oriented material. \nSeating is general admission\, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best seats. Premium VIP booths and tables are available for purchase and include food and beverage credits. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $31.14 – $101.65 (includes fees) \nTickets are available through official channels and resale platforms. Troy Bond shows sell out quickly — purchase early to secure your spot. \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/troy-bond-live-at-san-jose-improv/
LOCATION:San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, California\, 95113\, United States
